<title>RUSSIA: Reuters 10th ex-Moscow air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 10th ex-Moscow air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Moscow air cargo market rates in U.S. dollars per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>These rates exclude any cargo fuel surcharges, which are being applied by foreign airlines.</p>
<p>					 Feb 17   Jan 17</p>
<p>		    EUROPE</p>
<p> SVO(Moscow-Sheremetyevo)-FRA  1.15     1.13</p>
<p> SVO-LON			     1.21     1.20</p>
<p> SVO-LUX			     1.36     1.35</p>
<p>		    ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> SVO-BKK			     3.32     3.33</p>
<p> SVO-SEL			     4.04     4.04</p>
<p> SVO-NRT			     4.20     4.20</p>
<p>		    MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> SVO-DXB			     2.03     2.03</p>
<p> SVO-SHJ			     2.41     2.40</p>
<p>		    UNITED STATES</p>
<p> SVO-MIA			     3.38     3.38</p>
<p> SVO-NYC			     2.65     2.65</p>
<p> SVO-SFO			     3.25     3.25</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Moscow's Sheremetyevo international airport.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
